{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_4", "label": "Invariant 4 \u2014 Deterministic, versioned scores; a scorer change needs a new model version", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_5", "label": "Invariant 5 \u2014 Unknown is explicit (INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE carries no probability)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_6", "label": "Invariant 6 \u2014 No double counting (strongest-only per independence group)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "label": "Stage 35 \u2014 Provenance is not corroboration (implemented, golden, default)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirming a transcript faithfully records what a speaker said establishes provenance: the quotation is real. It says nothing about whether the speaker was right. An EVIDENCE_VERIFICATION task on an outline hands the worker the very sentence the claim was extracted from, and confirming it was scored as SUPPORT: 24 of the episode's 29 directional claims were supported only by the episode itself, so readers were shown \"Checks out so far\" where nothing outside the podcast was consulted \u2014 persuasion produced by accident."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_origin_not_row", "label": "One origin per source, derived, without merging rows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three URIs accounted for seven Source rows, and independence groups by evidence origin, so one URL being several rows let the same origin count twice \u2014 the double counting Invariant 6 forbids. Deriving a lineage key from the normalised canonical_uri at read time changes only the grouping: rows stay, nothing is mutated retrospectively, and two recordings of one URL remain two honest records by different people of one origin."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_provenance_factor", "label": "provenance_factor \u2014 a claim's own origin cannot support it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A link is self-referential when its evidence's origin is an origin the claim was extracted from, derivable deterministically from placement\u2192section\u2192source against link\u2192evidence\u2192location\u2192source. At SELF the weight is 0.0, exactly as MODEL_OUTPUT already is under observation_weight. The link is not discarded but kept, displayed and counted, because knowing a quotation is faithful is worth knowing; it simply stops being mistaken for corroboration."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_new_model_version", "label": "ledger-default@0.2.0 and ledger-strict@0.2.0, with 0.1.0 unchanged", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Invariant 4 requires a new version for a scorer change, so old numbers are not silently restated: a claim that read 0.83 under 0.1.0 still reads 0.83 under 0.1.0, and the change is visible as a model rather than applied as a correction. Forty trace hashes captured before and after were identical (digest 30b8f47c). LEDGER_DEFAULT_MODEL pins the default, because default_model returned the newest released model and ledger:release_models would otherwise have made the switch silently."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_group_by_origin_and_passage", "label": "Independence groups by origin AND passage, not origin alone", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The first cut keyed ungrouped evidence by origin, which collapsed every passage of one document into a single group and dropped a qualifier that a supporting line then outranked \u2014 a qualifier and a supporting sentence from one report are not each other repeated. Keying on origin plus excerpt_hash makes the same passage entered twice count once while two genuine passages stay distinct. A spec caught it."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_goldens_prove_nothing", "label": "The existing goldens prove nothing about the new rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All 20 cases scored identically under 0.2.0 and 0.1.0, which is not a coincidence to wave at: the demo corpus contains no self-origin evidence and no duplicated passage, so the two things this model changes never arise. A separate provenance suite was added to both implementations \u2014 reference_scorer.py and the Ruby spec \u2014 with no code shared, and the expectations were reasoned before they were run. Seven of eight predicted fields were right; the eighth was wrong and the scorer was right."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_origin_not_row", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_provenance_factor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_new_model_version", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_group_by_origin_and_passage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_goldens_prove_nothing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_origin_not_row", "target": "app_services_sources_origin_origin", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_origin_not_row", "target": "app_models_source_source", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_provenance_factor", "target": "app_services_scoring_calculate_calculate", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_provenance_factor", "target": "app_services_cards_plain_plain", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-35-provenance-is-not-corroboration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_35_provenance_is_not_corroboration_new_mo